=====Definitions=====
{{zh-hanzi-lite|sort=青00}}

# [[blue-green]]; [[blue]] (of sky, stone etc.); [[green]] (of grass, plants, mountain etc.)
#: {{zh-x|青天|'''blue''' sky}}
#: {{zh-x|青筋|'''blue''' veins}}
#: {{zh-x|青草|'''green''' grass}}
#: {{zh-x|青山綠水|'''green''' hills and rivers}}
